The models downloaded so far (sizes in MB):

```elixir
case File.ls("/data/models") do
  {:ok, files} ->
    for f <- Enum.sort(files), do: {f, div(File.stat!(Path.join("/data/models", f)).size, 1_000_000)}

  {:error, :enoent} ->
